        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "<h2>Who we are</h2><p>GAHAR is one of the three bodies of Egypt's Universal Health Insurance system, established under Law No. 2 of 2018. It accredits healthcare facilities, registers medical professionals and oversees the quality of healthcare services.</p><h2>Vision</h2><p>Towards better healthcare with international standards.</p><h2>Mission</h2><p>To ensure the quality and safety of healthcare services delivered to every citizen, through internationally recognised national standards and fair, transparent accreditation and oversight.</p>"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
